 ## Economics (defaults, owner-tunable within hard bounds)
 
+At launch (the edge schedule below moves these as the treasury grows):
+
 | | $FLIPPER flips | Token flips |
 |---|---|---|
 | Win chance | 45% | 45% while route cost ≤ 8%, then `(1 − h − 2%)/2` (≥ 40%) |
@@ -85,6 +87,29 @@
